        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion T7, Single Cylinder Blue Ridge Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Blue Ridge Single Cylinder Deadbolt was designed with historic America in mind. Its beautiful styling is reminiscent of days gone by, but it is also injected by the style trends of today for a deadbolt that looks uniquely rustic and contemporary at the same time. A single cylinder deadbolt, it is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. Choose from Antique pewter, medium bronze, and dark bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 100-T7 Single Cylinder Blue Ridge Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for American Relic Collection Blue Ridge Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
